  "title": "Millionaire&#39;s Shortbread",
  "description": "Millionaire&#39;s shortbread are deliciously decadent bar cookies with a buttery shortbread crust and a layer of rich caramel topped with smooth chocolate.",
  "authors": [
    "Miija Veley"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:18:34-05:00",
